      "html" : "<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170433\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170433\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFor SI: 1 inch = 25 mm.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170434\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170434\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta.&#160;&#160;&#160;The minimum dimension is permitted to be reduced to 8 inches for rectangular columns with two parallel sides at least 36 inches in length.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170435\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170435\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tb.&#160;&#160;&#160;The minimum dimension is permitted to be reduced to 10 inches for rectangular columns with two parallel sides at least 36 inches in length.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
